rrent context usage as a colored grid\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[41;118H  \u001b[38:2:153:153:153m/cost\u001b[39m                             \u001b[38:2:153:153:153mShow the total cost and duration of the current session\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[42;118H  \u001b[38:2:153:153:153m/doctor\u001b[39m                           \u001b[38:2:153:153:153mDiagnose and verify your Claude Code installation and settings\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[43;118H\u001b[K\u001b[1;44r\u001b[43;118H\u001b[?2026l"]
