[0.023396, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[6A\u001b[K\u001b[2B\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\u001b[5A\u001b[38:2:255:255:255m●\u001b[39m\u001b[1;43r\u001b[1;43r\u001b[118;245s\u001b[43;245H\n\u001b[1;43r\u001b[s\u001b[34;119H Perfect! I've generated a comprehensive KubeVirt integration test results report for the \"with-pause-tool\" test runs.\u001b[36;118H  \u001b[1mSummary\u001b[38;118H\u001b(B\u001b[m  The report has been saved to: \u001b[38:2:177:185:249mkubevirt-test-results-with-pause-tool-20251113-112350.md\u001b[40;118H\u001b[39m  \u001b[2mKey Findings:\u001b[42;118H\u001b(B\u001b[m  \u001b[1m100% Success Rate\u001b(B\u001b[m - All 4 agents passed the pause-vm task:\u001b[43;118H  - \u001b[K✅\u001b[1;43r\u001b[118;245s\u001b[43;245H\n\u001b[1;43r\u001b[s\u001b[42;124H Claude Code (v2.0.31)\u001b[43;118H  - \u001b[K✅\u001b[1;43r\u001b[118;245s\u001b[43;245H\n\u001b[1;43r\u001b[s\u001b[42;124H Gemini (Node.js agent)\u001b[43;118H  - \u001b[K✅\u001b[1;43r\u001b[118;245s\u001b[43;245H\n\u001b[1;43r\u001b[s\u001b[42;124H OpenAI Agent (Gemini 2.0 Flash)\u001b[43;118H  - \u001b[K✅\u001b[1;43r\u001b[118;245s\u001b[1;1H\u001b[20S\u001b[1;43r\u001b[s\u001b[23;124H OpenAI Agent (Granite 3.3 8B Instruct)\u001b[24;118H\u001b[K\n  \u001b[1mOptimal Efficiency:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[26;118H  - Every agent completed the task with exactly 1 tool call\u001b[K\u001b[27;118H  - No exploratory or redundant calls\u001b[K\u001b[28;118H  - Universal understanding of the \u001b[38:2:177:185:249mvm_pause\u001b[39m tool\u001b[K\u001b[29;118H\u001b[K\n  \u001b[1mKey Observations:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[31;118H  - The specialized \u001b[38:2:177:185:249mvm_pause\u001b[39m tool demonstrates exceptional effectiveness\u001b[K\u001b[32;118H  - Universal compatibility across diverse AI models and platforms\u001b[K\u001b[33;118H  - Consistent MCP protocol implementation (version 2025-06-18)\u001b[K\u001b[34;118H  - All agents correctly extracted parameters and handled responses\u001b[K\u001b[35;118H\u001b[K\n  \u001b[1mNote:\u001b(B\u001b[m I discovered a filename mismatch - the file labeled \"gemini-2.5-pro\" actually contains test results for\u001b[K\u001b[37;118H  \"Granite-3.3-8B-Instruct\" model. This is documented in the report.\u001b[K\u001b[38;118H\u001b[K\n  The report includes detailed sections covering executive summary, per-agent analysis, task-by-task breakdown, key\u001b[K\u001b[40;118H  findings, tool usage patterns, and actionable recommendations for production deployment, tool development, and testing\u001b[K\u001b[41;118H  improvements.\u001b[K\u001b[42;118H\u001b[K\n\u001b[38:2:215:119:87m*\u001b[39m \u001b[38:2:215:119:87mEnvisioning\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[38:2:235:159:127m…\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:215:119:87m \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:153:153:153m(\u001b[1mesc \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:153:153:153mto interrupt · 14s · ↓\u001b[39m\u001b[1;43r\u001b[118;245s\u001b[1;1H\u001b[2S\u001b[1;43r\u001b[s\u001b[41;160H \u001b[38:2:153:153:153m4.5k tokens)\u001b[39m\u001b[42;118H\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\u001b[38:2:177:185:249m\u001b[2m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1;43r\u001b[118;245s\u001b[43;245H\n\u001b[1;43r\u001b[s\u001b[43;118H\u001b[38:2:153:153:153m>\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[38:2:153:153:153m \u001b[39m\u001b[1;43r\u001b[118;245s\u001b[43;245H\n\u001b[1;43r\u001b[s\u001b[42;120H\u001b[7m \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[43;118H\u001b[K\u001b[38:2:177:185:249m\u001b[2m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1;43r\u001b[118;245s\u001b[43;245H\n\u001b[118G\u001b[K\u001b[1;44r\u001b[1;44r\u001b[s\u001b[43;118H\u001b[?2026l  \u001b[38:2:175:135:255m⏵⏵ accept edits on\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:153:153:153m (shift+tab to cycle)\u001b[39m       \u001b[38:2:255:107:128m✗ Auto-update failed ·\u001b[39m\u001b[1